            <ArticleTitle>An unusual mechanism of coronary stent dislodgment and localization.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>214-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Stent dislodgment from its delivery catheter is a rare yet clinically important entity in cardiac catheterization. We report a highly unusual case of stent loss and subsequent localization in the guiding catheter. Our hypothesized mechanism of stent dislodgment should be recognized by the medical community.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
